        "quote": "(a) Nomination. Any owner of an historic asset may nominate such asset as a local historic landmark. Any person may nominate an area within the City as a local historic district in accordance with this section. The applicant shall supply the following information on a form provided by the Planning Department:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.060:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.060 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "e128eb06-5d54-558b-8654-3b79042046b1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 602,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.060:block:1",
          "start": 311
        },
        "quote": "(1) A description of the specific historic asset nominated as an historic landmark or a list of specific historic assets located within the proposed district boundaries and a description of the particular importance or value of each historic asset, such description to include the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.060:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.060 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "fec78610-6681-5cf7-80c9-c58d172be968",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 718,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.060:block:2",
          "start": 603
        },
        "quote": "(i) A brief property history, including approximate date of construction, and dates of major alterations, if known;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.060:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
